  "solution": "**BODMAS Table: **\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\n**Given:** 42 ÷ 7 + 11 × 87 – 12 = 141 \n\nOption 1) ÷ and –\n\n**After interchanging the symbols,**\n\n→ 42 - 7 + 11 × **__87 ÷ 12__** = 141\n\n→ 42 - 7 + __**11 × 7.25 **__= 141\n\n→ 42 - __**7 + 79.75**__ = 141\n\n→ 42 - 86.75 = 141\n\n→ - 44.75 ≠ 141\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ÷ and +\n\n**After interchanging the symbols,**\n\n→ 42 +__** 7 ÷ 11 **__× 87 – 12 = 141\n\n→ 42 + __**0.63 × 87**__ – 12 = 141\n\n→ __**42 + 54.81**__ – 12 = 141\n\n→ __**96.81 - 12**__ = 141\n\n→ 84.81 ≠ 141\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) × and +**\n\n**After interchanging the symbols,**\n\n→ **__42 ÷ 7__ × 11 + 87 – 12** = 141\n\n→ __**6** ____× 11__ + 87 – 12 = 141\n\n→ __**66** ____+ 87__ – 12 = 141\n\n→ __**153** – 12__ = 141\n\n→ __**153 - 12 **__**= 141**\n\n→ **141** = 141\n\n→ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) – and × \n\n**After interchanging the symbols,**\n\n→ __**42 ÷ 7**__ + 11 × 87 – 12 = 141\n\n→ 6 + __**11 × 87**__ – 12 = 141\n\n→ __**6 + 957**__ – 12 = 141\n\n→ 963 – 12 = 141\n\n→ 951 ≠ 141\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
